{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1136077-grafting-body-parts","id":1136077,"title":"Grafting Body Parts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-31T20:51:09-07:00","id":1136077,"title":"Grafting Body Parts","content":"My players are heading towards an encounter with a group that's fundamentally Cheiron turned up to 11. So instead of just replacing an eye or a gland, they might instead give a werewolf's claws, a fish's gills, a demon's wings, or a monkeys tail. While possible to make these entirely bespoke, is there any precedent for this sort of thing to be able to build up a framework?<br /> <br /> Even if the drawbacks are bespoke, it'd be good to know where relative pieces might lie. I figure wings is probably the 5(6?)-dot end, and Evil Eye is a great example of what they'd be doing at 3-dot. But if any of the books have dealt with stuff like this I'm defiantly keen to learn more!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12891-polarbhang","name":"polarbhang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T21:16:37-07:00","id":1136080,"title":"","content":"Mechanically you should probably just use Horrors, from the Chronicles of Darkness rulebook. The appendages would be Dread Powers. Most Dread Powers don't have dots to them, so Flight would count as one Dread Power and Amphibiousness another. The tail could be cosmetic unless it does something, might I suggest a massive scorpion tail? The werewolf claws would be the Natural Weapon Dread Power, the scorpion tail, if you go with it, or any other poisonous attack would be the Toxic Dread Power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T23:05:03-07:00","id":1136100,"title":"","content":"Thank you so much, sounds perfect! I never would have thought about the scorpion tail either. Must do more reading.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12891,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12891-polarbhang","user":"polarbhang","date":". 09-01-2017, 02:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12891-polarbhang","name":"polarbhang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T02:28:42-07:00","id":1136121,"title":"","content":"By werewolf claws do you mean like a regular-looking hand that the graftee can force into dalu or gauru form?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T02:37:25-07:00","id":1136123,"title":"","content":"That was certainly an option that crossed my mind on the top end, but I would imagine there'd need to be some hefty drawbacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.c